  "biography": [
    "My research spans human-centric perception models, human physical foundation models, and unified humanoid control models. I study shared representations of the human body, hands, motion, and physical interactions to connect perception, motion generation, and control.",
    "My public work ranges from metric-scale human-scene reconstruction and egocentric hand-object recovery to language-guided, physics-based interaction synthesis. These directions motivate my broader interest in transferring human skills to humanoid robots. I am seeking Robotics Research Scientist opportunities."
